'''EPICFEST''' is one of the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] events in the Battle Cats. This Gacha Event was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0.0]] and includes all Uber Rare Cats from every common pool with a higher chance to obtain them. Additionally, the set includes the exclusive characters [[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow Gao]], [[Dark Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Mitama]], [[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'arktanyan]], [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli the Bane]], [[Dark Aegis Garu (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Aegis Garu]], [[Iz the Dancer of Grief (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz the Dancer of Grief]], [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Doom Phono]], [[Netherworld Nymph Lunacia (Uber Rare Cat)|Netherworld Nymph Lunacia]], and [[Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|Lone Moon Lunos]]. All EPICFEST exclusive Uber Rares have [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|anti-Traitless]] [[Special Abilities|special abilities]], although [[Kasli the Bane (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasli the Bane]], [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Doom Phono]], [[Netherworld Nymph Lunacia (Uber Rare Cat)|Netherworld Nymph Lunacia]] and [[Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|Lone Moon Lunos]] have ones that target enemies of other traits.

